        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jim Lindberg, Alison Moyet, Alan Vega, Davey Latter\n- Projects: The Black Pacific\n- Bands: Pennywise\n- Roles: singer, guitarist, songwriter, performer, vocalist, drummer, bassist\n- Topics: punk rock music\n\nFacts:\n- Alison Moyet was born on 18 June 1961 and is an English singer, songwriter, and performer noted for her bluesy contralto voice.\n- Jim Lindberg was born on July 26, 1965 and is an American singer and guitarist.\n- In 2010, Jim Lindberg, the vocalist of Pennywise, started the punk rock music project The Black Pacific with Alan Vega on drums and Davey Latter on bass.",
